  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Armenia HIV NFM - Armenia (01-Jan-2016-31-Mar-2019)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Armenia, HIV, Mission East (MEA)This program has the following goals: Maintain low level of HIV epidemic and provide HIV treatment to all who need it.. The objectives of this program are: Scale up ART to reach 90% of those in need of treatment.  Scale up HIV testing to ensure 75% of PLHIV know their status</narrative>
  </description>
